# BOOTSTRAP CELL FOR FINAL >25 KM MISROUTE DOUBLE-CHECK
#
# Run this ONCE immediately before:
#   "FINAL >25 KM MISROUTE DOUBLE-CHECK / RECOMPUTATION"
#
# Purpose:
#   Rebuild all PSAP geometry objects/functions required by the QA cell,
#   even if the notebook kernel was restarted.
